# D:\ Cabina Universal root wrapper repo
#
# This repo is intentionally narrow. It gives Codex and Git a native root for
# the cabin while preserving every nested repo as an independent clone.

# Ignore everything by default.
/*

# Never track local/system/sensitive areas.
/.secrets/
/$RECYCLE.BIN/
/System Volume Information/
/CodexBackups/
/**/.git/
/**/.git/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*secret*
**/*secreto*
**/*token*
**/*credential*
**/*password*
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/

